{
	chapter.04811F658EDCCC12.title: "Chapter 6 - Magnum Opus"
	chapter.0BD1CDFE30FE7DD3.title: "The Matrix"
	chapter.27B038826F5E6D4C.title: "Chapter 4 - Equivalent Exchange"
	chapter.2964DD4BA53E4F30.title: "3 - Utility"
	chapter.31B563EB5FE1353E.title: "1 - Logisitcs"
	chapter.3859FF557BD10E88.title: "2 - Decoration"
	chapter.5E8F7073B15616DD.title: "Chapter 5 - Staggering Reactors"
	chapter.668DDF4B2B5451C8.title: "Chapter 3 - Totally Not Oil"
	chapter.70093605703D6CCD.title: "Chapter 1 - The Basics"
	chapter.783928804E40322A.title: "Chapter 2 - Fluid Dynamics"
	chapter_group.18F50C423931A3D8.title: "Progression"
	chapter_group.6E3049D11D7C176F.title: "Information"
	file.0000000000000001.title: "Matrix of Materia"
	quest.00C810110A80E336.quest_desc: ["A type of Crystal Shard. It is used for making &lMagenta Materia&r."]
	quest.018B5C01A9EF402F.quest_desc: ["&lCrystallized Oil&r can be created by throwing &lCrystallized Canola Seeds&r in &lRefined Canola Oil&r."]
	quest.018B5C01A9EF402F.title: "Crystallizing Oil"
	quest.01EEA8827D1501B6.quest_desc: [
		"In order to create machines you will need other types of &lMateria&r."
		""
		"The most basic of which are &lRed \\& Gray Materia&r."
		"These can be created by crushing &lWhite Materia&r with &lCubic Materia&r."
	]
	quest.01EEA8827D1501B6.title: "Squish Make Flat"
	quest.03F23C3D5790E3A8.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone can be created by crushing &lRed Materia&r."
		"Most basic components are avaliable."
	]
	quest.05E1D8327A656ED2.quest_desc: ["Fun Fact: This chapter was originally going to have the second major content mod of the pack, Theurgy."]
	quest.05E1D8327A656ED2.title: "Lifeline 4"
	quest.071C4A4B77385AC2.title: "Materia Lamps"
	quest.0864D4909E4FF02B.quest_desc: ["Created by combining &lWhite Materia \\& Gray Materia&r."]
	quest.0C280E4860A4787B.quest_desc: [
		"The &lBlack Materia/Crude&r processing line is a very complicated automation line."
		"Here are a few notable tips that could help out:"
		""
		"- Centrifuging &lLiquid Black Materia&r creates &lLiquid White Materia&r and &lCrude&r. &lCrude&r has the same uses as &lLiquid Black Materia&r when it comes to this line."
		""
		"- It is recommended to build out each of the main lines from top to bottom. Or at least to set up processing for &lFuel Gas&r before &lHeavy Sludge&r."
		""
		"- &lObservers&r can detect when your &lMateria Deposit&r resets."
	]
	quest.0C280E4860A4787B.title: "Totally Not An Oil Line"
	quest.0DC921DEFD3F2137.quest_desc: [
		"&lOrange Materia&r is required for most fluid logistics at this stage of progression."
		"For now it must be created manually but it can be easily automated later."
	]
	quest.0EBFE26A96750FA6.title: "Framed Item Drawers"
	quest.104ABEDEF8D44350.title: "Crafting Grid"
	quest.10CB85B48E507C0D.quest_desc: [
		"&lItem&r and &lEnergy Pipes&r are incredibly useful for automation."
		""
		"Note that you can \"Daisy Chain\" machines as all machines are capable of both inputing and outputing power."
	]
	quest.10CB85B48E507C0D.title: "Basic Pipes"
	quest.10D5A5C0BCB86502.quest_desc: ["With all the automation tools at your disposal it shouldn't be too hard to automate the two most basic forms of &lMateria&r (apart from &lWhite Materia&r)."]
	quest.10D5A5C0BCB86502.title: "Mass Automation"
	quest.16DF770E9D1B6337.quest_desc: ["&lIntelligent Conduits&r can be used to transfer not only power but information efficiently."]
	quest.16FB4ACC34CE3937.quest_desc: [
		"&lLight Blue Materia&r is a form of materia with similar properties to &lOrange Materia&r."
		""
		"However its flexibility allows for the creation of improved fluid pipes."
	]
	quest.18A0679FB9AA1915.title: "Refined Storage Controller"
	quest.18B9447CE25E4840.quest_desc: ["In order to process &lBlack Materia&r you will need some better machines, and these machines need better components."]
	quest.18B9447CE25E4840.title: "Blue Machinery"
	quest.1ACBFC7F088CE32C.quest_desc: ["&lCoolant&r is required for certain reactor components."]
	quest.1ACBFC7F088CE32C.title: "Coolant"
	quest.1B6DD54613D1C579.quest_desc: [
		"&lWelcome to Matrix of Materia&r"
		"A 1.21.1 Automation Modpack focused purely on automation challenges."
		"The main limitation of this pack is the limited space you are given. At the end of each chapter you will be given an additional room (in addition to the one you start with)."
		""
		"To begin collect some &lWhite Materia&r by punching the &lMateria Deposit&r at the center of the room."
		""
		"The Information Category of the Questbook will show you the various logistics options, decorative stuff, and utility items avaliable to you."
	]
	quest.1B6DD54613D1C579.title: "Manual Labor"
	quest.1BBA8687A01F5B26.quest_desc: ["While the main Materia production of Chapter 1 remains completely unchanged throughout the pack, it will definitely be worth scaling up your Materia crushing setups."]
	quest.1BBA8687A01F5B26.title: "Chapter 1 Optimization"
	quest.1CF37EFF2BCF0CAB.quest_desc: ["The Perfect variants of the &lCentrifuge&r and &lMixer&r will be useful for optimizing production lines."]
	quest.1CF37EFF2BCF0CAB.title: "Perfected Mixing and Seperation"
	quest.1DAB71F17AE7F056.quest_desc: ["The &lPerfect Greenhouse&r may be one of the less useful Perfect Machines but it really helps with large scale canola production."]
	quest.1DADA3A8146A3BD7.quest_desc: ["A type of Shard Crystal that can be automated. This one is green."]
	quest.1E22C27CC397ECA1.quest_desc: [
		"The &lFission Reactor&r is the most complicated machine yet."
		"It requires two types of components to operate, &lHeat Exchangers&r, and &lReactor Cores&r."
		"These components have durability and must be replaced in order to maintain reactor functioning."
		""
		"The &lFission Reactor&r requires 20 &lRadiation Proof Casings&r anywhere in the 3x3x3 cube around it in order to work."
	]
	quest.1EB7939C31D9D61F.quest_desc: ["The &lMateria Burner&r can turn &lWhite Materia&r into power."]
	quest.1F03A63CA9BCFD94.quest_desc: ["&lBlue Polymer Bars&r are similar to &lYellow Polymer Bars&r but are used in ways similar to &lOrange Materia&r."]
	quest.217A4A4C7F23E64C.quest_desc: ["Useful for the creation of machines that can work with more advanced chemical processes."]
	quest.26B37CE45636BC64.quest_desc: [
		"&lHeavy Sludge&r's processing is heavily linked with &lFuel Gas&r as two of the outputs from its processing are used to turn the &lLight Fuel&r and &lHeavy Fuel&r you get from &lFuel Gas&r into better power sources."
		""
		"&lResidue&r is the most interesting of the four outputs. It can be reprocessed to get a little bit of &lHeavy Sludge&r back but it will leave you with some &lResidue&r in the output of the centrifuge."
	]
	quest.26B37CE45636BC64.title: "Heavy Sludge Processing"
	quest.28EFB4FA1B7D13C6.quest_desc: [
		"For some reason &lCanola&r is the only thing that grows here."
		""
		"This can be exploited to grow an infinite amount of it using a &lGreenhouse&r placed DIRECTLY below the barrier ceiling of any of your rooms."
	]
	quest.28EFB4FA1B7D13C6.title: "Greening My House"
	quest.2A026945869DD9D0.quest_desc: [
		"&lSulfuric Slurry&r has the most complicated processing line out of the three fluids but it results in two kinds of Materia."
		""
		"Maybe try to improve on your &lPure Water&r line from last chapter, as it is used here."
	]
	quest.2A026945869DD9D0.title: "Sulfuric Slurry Processing"
	quest.2B0C83C83D4F2ACB.quest_desc: [
		"&lAntimateria&r is required for all &lFusion Reactor&r recipes."
		""
		"It can be created through a process that combines all of your infinitely renewable base materials (&lWhite Materia&r, &lBlack Materia&r, &lCanola&r, and &lWater&r)."
	]
	quest.2B0C83C83D4F2ACB.title: "Antimateria"
	quest.2B25338B87A36F30.title: "Materia Windows"
	quest.2BF1AF0F9CA931C1.quest_desc: [
		"&lLime Materia&r is a highly radioactive form of Materia."
		""
		"It is useful for the creation advanced materials due to the relative lack of impurities."
	]
	quest.2BFAF8A0EC1DE905.quest_desc: ["You should have a decent stockpile of these if you aren't spamming &lChemical Reactors&r and framed blocks."]
	quest.2BFAF8A0EC1DE905.title: "Lifeline 2"
	quest.2C2C2555EB5DCDA6.quest_desc: ["Perfect Machines allow acces to creating &lRed&r, &lBlue&r, and &lGreen Crystal Shards&r through &lCrystal Slurry&r rather than the &lCrystallizer&r."]
	quest.2C2C2555EB5DCDA6.title: "Chapter 4 Optimization"
	quest.2D06FC7782CF333F.quest_desc: ["With &lBlue \\& Brown Materia&r automated you can move onto further processing."]
	quest.2D06FC7782CF333F.title: "Fluid Mastery"
	quest.2DC40690A3FB4686.title: "Materia Planks"
	quest.2EA1D47FE7608486.quest_desc: ["A type of Crystal Shard. It is used for making &lPink Materia&r."]
	quest.302AB9D81CC5EF4B.quest_desc: ["Created by combining &lWhite Materia \\& Red Materia&r."]
	quest.303C5E7B09936986.quest_desc: [
		"&lBlack Materia&r is a very a unique form of Materia."
		"Unlike other forms of Materia, rather than being processed from &lWhite Materia&r it must be drilled from its own deposit."
		""
		"The &lBlack Materia Deposit&r can be created by atomically reconstructing a &lMateria Deposit&r."
		"Once you have created a &lBlack Materia Deposit&r you will need a stronger drill as the basic one won't suffice."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"A &lLiquid-State Materia Driller&r is required to drill &lBlack Materia&r, note that it will produce &lLiquid Materia&r rather than &lSolid Materia&r as its name implies."
		""
		"&l&4WARNING:&r Not only does drilling &lBlack Materia&r requires the entire patch the drill is located on to be &lBlack Materia Deposits&r but it will occasionally return the Deposit to its original form."
	]
	quest.303C5E7B09936986.quest_subtitle: "The USA Will Arive in 7 Days"
	quest.303C5E7B09936986.title: "Definitely Not A Pumpjack"
	quest.30F60E640CD9DDFB.quest_desc: [
		"The &lManufactory&r is the most basic processing machine avaliable."
		"It can convert two input items into one output item."
	]
	quest.313E68FFA16B245D.quest_desc: [
		"The &lLiquid Burner&r can be used to turn the results of the &lFuel Gas&r line into power."
		""
		"This should cover your power production for both this chapter and the next."
	]
	quest.313EC78D2E746F94.quest_desc: [
		"&lPurple Materia&r is the next form of Materia you will obtain."
		""
		"It can be created by chemically reacting some Crystal Shards with &lLiquid White Materia&r."
	]
	quest.316DCF2B1617ECE7.quest_desc: ["Chapter 1's automation should be producing an extreme excess of these."]
	quest.316DCF2B1617ECE7.title: "Lifeline 1"
	quest.3293015EC935D39D.quest_desc: ["&lPerfect Plates&r are the ultimate version of plates. They act both like &lChemically Inert Plates&r and &lRadiation Proof Plates&r"]
	quest.33BFA1C020326F69.quest_desc: ["Once you have automated Crystal Shards automating these two types of Materia should be trivial."]
	quest.33BFA1C020326F69.title: "Alchemical Prowess"
	quest.36C4A8910BF25AC4.quest_desc: ["The &lPerfect Isotope&r is the basis of the final tier of components, Perfect Components."]
	quest.36CD51CB4CEDE44A.quest_desc: ["&lGray Materia&r is a metallic material useful for the contstruction of machinery."]
	quest.3986721B6A1B96ED.quest_desc: ["This chapter offers some alternative ways to do some of Chapter 3's processing."]
	quest.3986721B6A1B96ED.title: "Better Totally Not Oil Processing"
	quest.3A5ABB9202D1BD35.title: "Fluid Drawers"
	quest.3DAF32129769A4FC.quest_desc: [
		"These circuit are capable of processing large amounts of data efficiently."
		""
		"NOTE: It's ok not to automatically produce these however it is recommended as they will be used in a large number of future machine recipes."
	]
	quest.3E391D09CF7BA860.quest_desc: [
		"After all this time, all the automation you have finally obtained it, &lRainbow Materia&r."
		""
		"Thank you for playing &lMatrix of Materia&r. This pack has been a lot of fun to work on for me and I hope it was a lot of fun to play for you as well."
	]
	quest.3E391D09CF7BA860.title: "The Magnum Opus"
	quest.400E2AA55648508D.quest_desc: [
		"&lCyan Materia&r is a highly dense and radiation resistant form of Materia."
		""
		"It can be created by exploding &lWhite Materia&r."
	]
	quest.400E2AA55648508D.title: "Cyan Materia"
	quest.405A4BAE47226EA8.quest_desc: ["The main optimizations for Chapter 2 are not only the fact that &lCrystallized Canola Oil&r can be created with the &lChemical Reactor&r but &lWater&r can now be centrifuged into &lHydrogen&r and &lOxygen&r."]
	quest.405A4BAE47226EA8.title: "Chapter 2 Optimization"
	quest.407836134DAFB281.quest_desc: [
		"A faster &lMateria Driller&r that can produce both solid and liquid Materia."
		""
		"The pipes used in the recipes are NOT consumed."
	]
	quest.40C7BC5F47AE64E6.quest_desc: [
		"&lWhite Materia&r is the basis of most Materia production lines."
		""
		"A blank canvas which can have its properties changed on a whim based on various processes."
	]
	quest.43C29937A40AD71A.quest_desc: ["The primary optimization avaliable for Chapter 5 is &lFormulated Fuel&r. It allows for faster &lGreen&r and &lLime Materia&r production if set up right."]
	quest.43C29937A40AD71A.title: "Chapter 5 Optimization"
	quest.452749D5D12656C0.quest_desc: [
		"&lBlack Materia&r is the opposite of White Materia."
		""
		"Rather than a blank canvas that can have its properties changed through various processes, Black Materia is a mishmash of various bits and pieces that it can be distilled down to through chemical processes."
	]
	quest.47B405EAA62A400A.quest_desc: [
		"The &lMelter&r and &lReformer&r are machines used in many lines."
		"The increased throughput of the Perfect variants reduces the number of bottlenecks these machines create."
	]
	quest.47B405EAA62A400A.title: "Perfected Matter Manipulation"
	quest.48070E14B4BFED52.quest_desc: [
		"&lCyan Materia&r is highly resistant to radiation."
		""
		"It is useful for the construction of reactors and the components necessary for their operation."
	]
	quest.48358E6736BDE237.quest_desc: ["&lBrown Materia&r is primarily used for decorative pieces to make your factory look nicer."]
	quest.48AC42FA7F653192.quest_desc: ["A improved variant of the Precision Manufactory for when you need more processing power."]
	quest.4A0A80CC5265BA4F.quest_desc: ["The &lPrecision Manufactory&r is an improved version of the &lManufactory&r."]
	quest.4AC7452BE64C462F.quest_desc: ["You may have to disable your polymer production for this."]
	quest.4AC7452BE64C462F.title: "Lifeline 3"
	quest.4B972891759DD16A.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have &lCanola&r growing you will want to process it."
		"This can be done with some simple machines such as the &lCanola Press&r and &lFermenting Barrel&r."
	]
	quest.4D8B421A3CF1CC6B.quest_desc: [
		"&lPurple Materia&r is form of Materia with strange properties that can be created through alchemical methods."
		""
		"While mostly resistant to alchemical processes which makes it a good material to protect machine parts, it can be transmuted into other forms of materia with the right processes."
	]
	quest.4F138B479A1B2553.quest_desc: [
		"The &lCrucible&r is capable of performing some amount of alchemical processing including the automation of the &lMutating Salt&r."
		""
		"Additionally the &lCrucible&r can create another type of salt, &lReturning Salt&r. Which can return crystals to a previous or similar form."
	]
	quest.4F1B44ECE26FADCE.quest_desc: ["The &lPaxel&r, and &lWrench&r will be incredibly useful tools throughout the pack."]
	quest.4F1B44ECE26FADCE.title: "Tools of the Trade"
	quest.4F5C79018B874D45.quest_desc: [
		"&lPink Materia&r is a derivative of &lPurple Materia&r."
		""
		"While losing its alchemical resistance it becomes more suited toward use in advanced components."
	]
	quest.5115571D05597E84.title: "Framed Fluid Buckets"
	quest.54526E4ADD5A456D.quest_desc: ["Try mutating &lRed Crystal Shards&r."]
	quest.54CDB687909E9D67.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have fully automated the three most basic types of &lMateria&r it is time to look towards further horizons."
		""
		"This quest will give you a &lRoom Key&r with when used on one of the locks on the side of a room can create an additional room."
		""
		"It could be a fun challenge to minimize the number of rooms you use."
		""
		"UPDATE: On the 15th of May 2026, roidrole managed to complete the one room challenge."
	]
	quest.54CDB687909E9D67.title: "Expanding Your Factory"
	quest.55FE0DD13A97A810.quest_desc: ["&lMutating Salt&r causes Crystal Shards to mutate when turned into Crystal Clusters changing their color."]
	quest.565614259DD6671B.quest_desc: [
		"The &lDistillery&r is one of the main machines used for the processing of &lBlack Materia&r."
		""
		"&lNote:&r It will need one &lChemically Inert Casing&r above it for each output in the recipe it is currently performing."
	]
	quest.59D0E6C82403EDA1.quest_desc: ["Broken reactor components can be recycled for some scrap and their harder to automate components."]
	quest.59D0E6C82403EDA1.title: "Component Recycling"
	quest.59DC237F396768E4.quest_desc: [
		"&lGreen Materia&r is a radioactive form of materia."
		""
		"It has some similar properties to &lLime Materia&r but its more impure structure allows for different uses in production."
	]
	quest.5B5D3A140BC15C0C.quest_desc: ["Your Perfect &lIsotope Production&r may make your supply of these rather low. "]
	quest.5B5D3A140BC15C0C.title: "Lifeline 5"
	quest.5D5BD177C14633A0.quest_desc: ["&lRed Materia&r is highly conductive."]
	quest.5D79FA1B17BD4865.quest_desc: [
		"&lCircuits&r are the most important of the basic machine components."
		"They can be created with two &lWires&r and a &lPlate&r."
	]
	quest.5DD96C53235DF37E.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have automated this chapter's three types of materia you can move on to the next chapter."
		"It's going to be a fun one."
	]
	quest.5DD96C53235DF37E.title: "I Told You It Wasn't Oil"
	quest.5F707E16B03D0F02.quest_desc: [
		"Now with your &lFission Reactor&r and reactor components you can begin creatin &lGreen&r and &lLime Materia&r."
		""
		"As the EMI section for the &lFission Reactor&r is INCREDIBLY cluttered so here are the various recipes written out:"
		""
		"Liquid Cyan + Liquid Purple = Liquid Green \\& Liquid Black"
		""
		"Liquid Black + Liquid Orange = Liquid Green \\& Liquid Cyan"
		""
		"Liquid Purple + Liquid Orange = Liquid Green \\& Liquid Lime"
		""
		"Liquid Green + Residue = Liquid Lime \\& Unrefined Polymer"
		""
		"Liquid Green + Blue Materic Sludge = Liquid Lime \\& Liquid Blue"
		""
		"Liquid Black + Crude = Sulfuric Slurry \\& Residue"
		""
		"Liquid Green + Liquid Lime = Perfect Slurry \\& Liquid White"
	]
	quest.5F707E16B03D0F02.title: "Nuclear Science"
	quest.62627471041708C9.quest_desc: ["&lOrange Materia&r is useful for Fluid Logistics."]
	quest.62CC08DC76B16AD5.quest_desc: ["&lPerfect Wires&r are capable of sending both energy and information without any loss."]
	quest.62E1F2BA89E07546.quest_desc: [
		"With these new machines you should have all the tools you need to automate &lBlue Materia&r (as well as &lBrown Materia&r)."
		""
		"Note that this will likely require a second Cubic Materia setup as &lRed \\& Gray Materia&r can be used in the processing line."
		"It is also recommended to automate &lOrange Materia&r here as well."
	]
	quest.62E1F2BA89E07546.title: "Basics of Chemistry"
	quest.639C3993D400167E.quest_desc: ["&lFuel Gas&r is the simplest of the three fluids to process, as all it takes is a distilling the &lFuel Gas&r and mixing the results with materials from your &lHeavy Sludge&r line."]
	quest.639C3993D400167E.title: "Fuel Gas Processing"
	quest.658947C9DFEC0ADA.quest_desc: ["The &lMelter&r and &lReformer&r are able to change the state of matter that your materia takes."]
	quest.658947C9DFEC0ADA.title: "Manipulation of Matter"
	quest.65CEA274944E314A.quest_desc: [
		"The &lFusion Reactor&r is the only machine capable of creating &lRainbow Materia&r."
		""
		"It requires a similar structure to the &lFission Reactor&r except it uses &lPerfect Casings&r."
	]
	quest.65D4E9D2B510DFA2.title: "Item Drawers"
	quest.669007C792637EC8.quest_desc: ["A type of Shard Crystal that can be automated. This one is light blue."]
	quest.66CC9C8237A82FC0.quest_desc: ["The &lPerfect Circuit&r is the most advanced type of circuit capable of processing vast amounts of information at high speeds."]
	quest.66CFEB21DDED0B33.quest_desc: ["&lRed Crystal Clusters&r can be created by crystallizing &lRedstone Dust&r or &lRed Crystal Shards&r with salt."]
	quest.68A6D46D941C98D9.quest_desc: ["The &lMixer&r and &lCentrifuge&r are the most basic ways to process chemicals."]
	quest.68A6D46D941C98D9.title: "Mixing and Seperation"
	quest.68D67B77A76FC144.quest_desc: ["&lComposite Polymer Bars&r will be heavily used in various machine and component recipes."]
	quest.6AFE3E3B8B3CE6D2.quest_desc: [
		"In order to build a &lFission Reactor&r you will need a way to house it."
		"This requires &lRadiation Proof Casings&r."
		""
		"When used in recipes &lCyan Materia&r will sometimes leave behind &lCyan Scrap&r which can be reprocessed for &lCyan Materia&r."
	]
	quest.6AFE3E3B8B3CE6D2.title: "Radiation Proof Casing"
	quest.6B16A025FC90519B.quest_desc: ["&lYellow Polymer Bars&r are useful for the construction of &lCurvy Item Pipes&r as well as advanced machines and components."]
	quest.6C6E687A105AA010.quest_desc: [
		"The &lChemical Reactor&r is a machine that will see a good amount of use from here on out due to its wide applications in automation."
		""
		"&lNote:&r The &lChemical Reactor&r requires &lChemically Inert Casings&r directly above and bellow it in order to opperate."
	]
	quest.6E34D1424AB37475.quest_desc: ["As it will be nearly impossible to finish this chapter in a single room (unless your name is Roidrole) unlike each of the previous chapters you will be provided with five &lLifelines&r each giving one additional key."]
	quest.6E34D1424AB37475.title: "Lifelines"
	quest.6EFAE9B21D5F7659.quest_desc: [
		"&lYellow Materia&r is a good material for advanced item pipes."
		""
		"It's flexibility and relative resistance allow for various uses in production as well."
	]
	quest.705FDEEEFF15D4EF.quest_desc: ["Chapter 3 doesn't have too many specific automations but access to Curvy Pipes as well as a few new recipes here and there allow for some cleaner lines."]
	quest.705FDEEEFF15D4EF.title: "Chapter 3 Optimization"
	quest.70C1318EB406E082.quest_desc: ["Automating &lGreen&r and &lLime Materia&r shouldn't be too difficult considering all you have gone through to get to this point."]
	quest.70C1318EB406E082.title: "It's Not Rocket Science"
	quest.71B7A0836C61CBF0.title: "Matercrete"
	quest.726F7D55639148A8.quest_desc: [
		"The &lCrystallizer&r is an interesting machine."
		""
		"Requires air directly above it to function."
		""
		"It can take a Crystal Shard (or redstone dust as it has a similar structure to the &lRed Crystal Shard&r) and some salt and grow a Crystal Cluster."
		""
		"Note that the recipe outputs are not shown in EMI and some have multiple different outputs so it might be worth using the Book and Quill that this quest gives you in order to keep track of the recipe outputs."
	]
	quest.72E2BB9F26BFBD8D.quest_desc: [
		"&lMagenta Materia&r is a derivative of &lPurple Materia&r."
		""
		"It can be used to send signals at a distance."
	]
	quest.74EB7A3313EB1606.quest_desc: ["The &lBasic Materia Driller&r can automatically produce &lWhite Materia&r when placed on a &lMateria Deposit&r and powered."]
	quest.758DF9ED26770083.quest_desc: [
		"Perfect Machines are the final tier of Machines."
		""
		"All Perfect Machines except the &lFusion Reactor&r can run the recipes of their normal variants and can run two at a time."
	]
	quest.758DF9ED26770083.title: "Perfect Machines"
	quest.75B815E9319784C3.quest_desc: [
		"&lRainbow Materia&r is the ultimate form of Materia."
		""
		"It has the properties of all the previous forms of Materia combine together into the ultimate Omni-Material™."
	]
	quest.798ADAC7F97C2FBE.quest_desc: ["The &lPhantom Resonator&r is a useful component that can transfer signals over a distance."]
	quest.79941ED9754E3C6A.title: "Materia Bricks"
	quest.79CEAD9651434570.quest_desc: [
		"The perfect variants of the Chapter 3 machines are incredibly useful especially for the additional recipes they unlock."
		""
		"Note: The Perfect Distillery is optional for the &lAntimateria Quest&r."
	]
	quest.79CEAD9651434570.title: "Perfected Chemistry"
	quest.7B08FD94B73358C4.quest_desc: ["The &lAtomic Reconstructer&r can reconstruct atoms. (Who even wrote this?)"]
	quest.7C245A55E69FE2EC.quest_desc: ["These blocks are useful for the automation of &lCubic Materia&r processing."]
	quest.7C245A55E69FE2EC.title: "World Interaction"
	quest.7CA88CDB2BA74716.quest_desc: ["While &lPure Water&r is finite (or as finite as anything made from Materia can be) regular old &lWater&r can make an infinite source in world."]
	quest.7DCB3A34EE08750B.quest_desc: ["&lLight Gray Materia&r is a very stable material capable of being processed into useful plastics."]
	quest.7EB235939DBB3FC8.quest_desc: ["&lCurvy Energy Pipes&r are practically required to power certain &lChemical Reactor&r recipes."]
	quest.7FD1E26751147B23.quest_desc: ["&lPerfect Casings&r are the best form of casing avaliable."]
